## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.5 Plus
- **Short description:** Alibaba's mid-generation Qwen3.5 Plus multimodal model (Feb 2026 baseline; 1M context). Likely superseded by 3.6/3.7/3.8 series.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (DashScope); text/image/video in; text out.
- **Release / knowledge:** GA Feb 16–20 (2 snapshots); knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `qwen3.5-plus` (Alibaba), OpenRouter likely `qwen/qwen3.5-plus`
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens; max output 65,536. Verified via docs.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video in; text out. Function calling, structured outputs, web search, prefix completion, context caching.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** International $0.40/$2.40 per 1M (≤256 K? actually ≤128k China/global pricing; Singapore $0.4/$2.4 up to 256K then higher). China lower.
- **Architecture:** Hybrid linear-attention + MoE (per Alibaba docs), no open weights listed? (Qwen 3.5 family had open weights for 397B etc; 3.5 Plus maybe hosted-only or released later; not verified here.)

